## LA-V PMC

dh-uprising-sender-vanguard = Lost Angels—Vanguard
dh-uprising-pmc-called = Lost Angels—Vanguard is sending an evacuation flight with a private military contractor team into the district. It lands at LZ-1 Aeronautics in { $minutes } min. LA-V staff, make your way to the pad.
dh-uprising-pmc-called-evac = A private military contractor team is flying in on the LA-V evacuation flight. Landing at LZ-1 Aeronautics in { $minutes } min.
dh-uprising-pmc-landed = The LA-V contractor team has landed at LZ-1 Aeronautics. The flight waits { $minutes } min for the corporate representative. Any interference will be suppressed.
dh-uprising-pmc-call-done = LA-V PMC team called: arrives on the evacuation flight at LZ-1 in { $minutes } min.
dh-uprising-pmc-call-done-now = LA-V PMC team deployed from the flight already on LZ-1.
dh-uprising-pmc-call-pending = The LA-V PMC team is already on its way.
dh-uprising-briefing-pmc =
    You are a contractor of the Lost Angels—Vanguard private military company.
    The corporation has sent your team for its representative in a district gripped by unrest. The flight will not wait at LZ-1 Aeronautics for long.
    Your task is to get the LA-V representative out at any cost, and the other corporate staff if you can. Follow your team commander. The Military Police and the Front are not your allies, but not your targets either: do not start someone else's war unless it stands between you and the representative.

dh-job-lav-pmc-commander-name = LA-V PMC commander
dh-job-lav-pmc-commander-desc = Lead the contractor team: find the LA-V representative and get them on board.
dh-job-lav-pmc-medic-name = LA-V PMC medic
dh-job-lav-pmc-medic-desc = Keep the team and the representative on their feet until the flight takes off.
dh-job-lav-pmc-specialist-name = LA-V PMC specialist
dh-job-lav-pmc-specialist-desc = Cover the team from afar with the LAVR-90: marksmen, gunners, ambushes.
dh-job-lav-pmc-rifleman-name = LA-V PMC rifleman
dh-job-lav-pmc-rifleman-desc = Go first in heavy armour and shield the representative.
dh-job-lav-pmc-supervisors = the LA-V board of directors
dh-job-lav-pmc-supervisors-squad = the PMC team commander

dh-ghost-role-lav-pmc-commander-name = LA-V PMC commander
dh-ghost-role-lav-pmc-commander-desc = Lead a team of four: get the LA-V representative out through LZ-1 at any cost, the others if you can.
dh-ghost-role-lav-pmc-medic-name = LA-V PMC medic
dh-ghost-role-lav-pmc-medic-desc = Combat medic of the LA-V contractor team: the representative must fly out alive.
dh-ghost-role-lav-pmc-specialist-name = LA-V PMC specialist
dh-ghost-role-lav-pmc-specialist-desc = Marksman of the LA-V contractor team with the LAVR-90 light sniper rifle.
dh-ghost-role-lav-pmc-rifleman-name = LA-V PMC rifleman
dh-ghost-role-lav-pmc-rifleman-desc = Heavy-armoured assaulter of the LA-V contractor team with the LAVR-55.
dh-name-format-lav-pmc-commander = Commander {$part0}
dh-name-format-lav-pmc-medic = Medic {$part0}
dh-name-format-lav-pmc-specialist = Specialist {$part0}
dh-name-format-lav-pmc-rifleman = Rifleman {$part0}

dh-integrated-mask-occupied = Take off your mask first: the helmet has a built-in gas mask.
dh-armor-verb-class-parts = Class [color=cyan]{ $level }[/color]: { $parts }.

cmd-dhcalllavpmc-desc = Calls the LA-V PMC team (4 ghost roles) on an Aeronautics flight to LZ-1 in the Uprising mode.
cmd-dhcalllavpmc-help = Usage: dhcalllavpmc
dh-admin-tab-call-lav-pmc = Call the LA-V PMC team (Uprising)
dh-admin-tab-call-lav-pmc-tooltip = A team of four ghost roles (commander, medic, specialist, rifleman) arrives on the evacuation flight at LZ-1 Aeronautics: the one already ordered, or one is ordered from the LA-V budget (40,000 cr.) and arrives in 3 min; no money, no flight. Their task is to get the LA-V representative out. The flight waits 12 min. Uprising mode only.
dh-uprising-pmc-call-no-funds = No evacuation ordered and the LA-V budget has { $balance } cr. of { $cost } — the flight with the team will not come.
dh-bank-note-evac-pmc = evacuation flight with the PMC team
